+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Your Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to our coffee</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Good coffee. Less data.</h1>
+    <p>Your privacy should come as standard. This page describes the current Daily Grind website.</p>
+    <h2>Browse without being tracked</h2>
+    <p>This application uses no cookies, analytics, advertising trackers, fingerprinting, or browser storage.
+      You do not need to create an account to browse. We do not collect names, email addresses, or payment details.</p>
+    <h2>Only what is needed to deliver a page</h2>
+    <p>When you visit, your browser sends connection information such as your IP address and requested page
+      to the hosting infrastructure. The application uses the request to deliver the page and does not write
+      request logs or retain visitor records. Hosting providers may process connection information in their own
+      operational or security logs; their retention depends on the deployment configuration.</p>
+    <h2>No background sharing</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this website. Your browser does not contact image providers,
+      font services, social widgets, or analytics vendors to display these pages. The application does not sell
+      visitor data or use it for marketing.</p>
+    <h2>Protection by default</h2>
+    <p>The site limits browser permissions and restricts scripts and external content. It does not send the
+      address of the page you were viewing as a referrer when you follow a link.</p>
+    <h2>Your data and choices</h2>
+    <p>There is no application profile or visitor database to access, correct, export, or delete, and no
+      optional tracking to opt out of. Account, rewards, and ordering services are not implemented on this site.
+      If those services are added, their data practices and controls will need to be explained before collection begins.</p>
+    <p>For questions about hosting logs, contact the operator of the website using the contact details provided
+      by your hosting or deployment service. No visitor request form is available on this site.</p>
+    <p><a href="/">Return to The Daily Grind</a></p>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p>
+    <a href="/privacy-policy" aria-current="page">Privacy</a>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+</html>
